      "value": "@{5bab4096e98ddc66e3477da5|full_name}: Position your main camera so it can only see your avatar (it helps if it's in an empty scene), hit play and then open the profiler window. A detailed explanation of its interface can be found at https://docs.unity3d.com/Manual/Profiler.html.",
