      "value": "@{59b80cbbd1662e660835c7c5|full_name}: Thank you but how does any of that information translate to performance specifically in VRchat and how VRchat handles processing the various avatar components?\n\nObviously statistics we see in a base Unity project are going to be very different from VRchat, let alone VRchat under various circumstances dependent on other avatars being in the world / world optimization, etc.\n\nFor instance, VRchat's new method of transmitting IK is supposed to have a positive impact on performance, but how is that measured using Unity's Profiler?\n\nThis all loops back around to the original post.  Some kind of context as to how these components translate to performance in VRchat would be great.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
