      "value": "@{5bab4096e98ddc66e3477da5|full_name}: It's not gonna have things like IK and voice overhead, but you'll be able to see most of what you have control over, like mesh performance, dynamicbone and cameras, the metric to look at being the amount of time it takes to process for each frame/update. The request still stands, this is just the easiest way to analyze performance impact for the time being.",
